        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Keccak-256 (Ethereum's pre-standard SHA-3 variant) is the SDK's core hash: EIP-712 typed-data hashing (struct.py, types.py), EIP-191 personal-message hashing in the signer (eth_signer.py), CREATE/CREATE2 address precomputation (precompute_contract_deployer.py), and matching unit/integration tests. Not a TLS KEX hash; only Grover-affected, so A- rating stands. Changeable here only insofar as Ethereum consensus fixes Keccak-256 — the algorithm is dictated by the protocol, not by this repo."
